Package: linux-whatsapp-web
Version: 0.1.1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: KodOkullari contributors <67424830+KodOkullari@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: bash (>= 4), python3
Homepage: https://github.com/KodOkullari/linux-whatsapp.web
Description: Brave WhatsApp Web PWA setup and IBus diagnostic helper
 Discovers an installed WhatsApp Web PWA in Brave, creates a correctly grouped
 desktop launcher, and safely diagnoses common IBus keyboard-input failures.
 It contains no browser, message, cookie, QR, or WhatsApp session data.
